==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 3~14 seconds<sup>90f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 3~14 seconds<sup>90f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6~14 seconds<sup>180f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 6~14 seconds<sup>180f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**8 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 40% HP:
**4 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
With the lack of strong enemies, you are able to rush the base with [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] or other rushers. The enemies that come out from hitting the base may scare you looking at how many there are, but the enemy limit is trapped at 5 meaning they will just burrow under your Giraffe Cats. Paired with the long stage width, it makes the stage easy to rush.

